{"id": "EUVD-2026-96392", "enisaUuid": "204804d0-e4e5-397b-a8b0-276dbcb77d32", "description": "open-multi-agent (@open-multi-agent/core) 1.5.0 through 1.21.2 contains a link following vulnerability in the file_write tool sandbox that allows attackers to create files outside the workspace root by using dangling symlinks. Attackers can plant a dangling symlink in the workspace and steer the agent via prompt injection to write attacker-influenced content anywhere the agent process can write.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T18:58:16", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T18:54:52", "baseScore": 5.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind/open-multi-agent-file-write-dangling-symlink-escape", "https://github.com/open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent/blob/6ec5498643c7e431aa66751f17f47a529e7f927c/packages/core/src/tool/built-in/path-safety.ts#L104-L113", "https://github.com/open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent/blob/6ec5498643c7e431aa66751f17f47a529e7f927c/packages/core/src/tool/built-in/file-write.ts#L67", "https://github.com/open-multi-agent/open-multi-agent", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/open-multi-agent-1.5.0-through-1.21.2-sandbox-escape-via-file-write-dangling-symlink"], "aliases": ["GHSA-h42w-g3ch-rjjm", "CVE-2026-108600"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.15, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ce8e4458-59e6-3501-a5eb-7823e0a55384", "product": {"name": "open-multi-agent", "vendor": {"name": "open-multi-agent"}}, "product_version": "1.5.0 \u22641.21.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "f0fb8f10-e20e-3339-a5e5-9054da549510", "vendor": {"name": "open-multi-agent"}}], "isExploited": false}